<title>UK: Depfa sets 1.5 bln mark bond due March 2003.</title>
<headline>Depfa sets 1.5 bln mark bond due March 2003.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel-Bank, Bayerische Vereinsbank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and Goldman Sachs.</p>
<p>BORROWER  DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    20.MAR.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    09.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.275     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER.</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1	   LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.175     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND JAN.2003 BUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
